<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Chek - TechMarket</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; }
    body { background: #f5f5f5; min-height: 100vh; padding: 2rem; }
    .receipt-container { max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); overflow: hidden; }
    .receipt-header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb 0%, #1d4ed8 100%); color: #fff; padding: 2rem; text-align: center; }
    .receipt-header h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .receipt-header p { opacity: 0.9; font-size: 0.875rem; }
    .receipt-body { padding: 1.5rem; }
    .receipt-info { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px dashed #e5e7eb; }
    .info-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.875rem; }
    .info-label { color: #6b7280; }
    .info-value { font-weight: 600; color: #1f2937; text-align: right; max-width: 60%; word-break: break-all; }
    .receipt-items { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .receipt-item { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0.75rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; }
    .receipt-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .item-left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.25rem; }
    .item-name { font-weight: 500; color: #1f2937; font-size: 0.875rem; }
    .item-serial { font-size: 0.7rem; color: #9ca3af; font-family: monospace; }
    .item-right { text-align: right; }
    .item-qty-price { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #6b7280; }
    .item-total { font-weight: 600; color: #2563eb; font-size: 0.875rem; }
    .receipt-total { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1f2937; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 2px solid #e5e7eb; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .receipt-footer { background: #f9fafb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .footer-section { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .footer-section:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .footer-title { font-weight: 600; color: #1f2937; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.875rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .footer-text { color: #4b5563; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6; }
    .contact-btn { display: inline-block; background: #2563eb; color: #fff; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.875rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; transition: background 0.2s; }
    .contact-btn:hover { background: #1d4ed8; }
    .btn-print { width: 100%; padding: 1rem; background: #1f2937; color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1rem; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .btn-print:hover { background: #374151; }
    .btn-home { width: 100%; padding: 1rem; background: #fff; color: #2563eb; border: 1px solid #2563eb; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1rem; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; text-align: center; display: block; }
    .btn-home:hover { background: #eff6ff; }
    @media print {
      body { background: #fff; padding: 0; }
      .receipt-container { box-shadow: none; max-width: 100%; }
      .btn-print, .btn-home { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="receipt-container">
    <div class="receipt-header">
      <h1>✅ Buyurtma qabul qilindi</h1>
      <p>TechMarket - Kompyuter aksessuarlari</p>
    </div>

    <div class="receipt-body">
      <div class="receipt-info">
        <div class="info-row"><span class="info-label">Buyurtma raqami</span><span class="info-value">#<%= Date.now().toString(36).toUpperCase() %></span></div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="info-label">Sana</span><span class="info-value"><%= new Date().toLocaleString('uz-UZ') %></span></div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="info-label">Telegram</span><span class="info-value">@<%= telegram_username %></span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="receipt-items">
        <% cart.forEach(item => { %>
          <div class="receipt-item">
            <div class="item-left">
              <span class="item-name"><%= item.name %> × <%= item.qty %></span>
              <span class="item-serial">Seriya: <%= item.serial %></span>
            </div>
            <div class="item-right">
              <div class="item-qty-price"><%= formatPrice(item.price) %> × <%= item.qty %></div>
              <div class="item-total"><%= formatPrice(item.price * item.qty) %></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% }) %>
      </div>

      <div class="receipt-total">
        <span>Jami to'lov</span>
        <span><%= formatPrice(total) %></span>
      </div>

      <div class="receipt-footer">
        <div class="footer-section">
          <div class="footer-title">💬 Aloqa</div>
          <div class="footer-text">Sotuvchi siz bilan Telegram orqali bog'lanadi:</div>
          <a href="https://t.me/<%= seller_telegram.replace('@', '') %>" target="_blank" class="contact-btn">Sotuvchiga yozish →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-section">
          <div class="footer-title">🚚 Yetkazib berish</div>
          <div class="footer-text">Tovar 5 ish kuni ichida yetkazib beriladi. Yetkazib berish bepul.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-section">
          <div class="footer-title">💳 To'lov</div>
          <div class="footer-text">To'lov qo'lda amalga oshiriladi (naqd / karta / click / payme). Sotuvchi bog'laganda aniqlanadi.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <button class="btn-print" onclick="window.print()">🖨️ Chekni chop etish / PDF saqlash</button>
      <a href="/" class="btn-home">🏠 Bosh sahifaga qaytish</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    window.addEventListener('beforeprint', () => document.body.classList.add('printing'));
    window.addEventListener('afterprint', () => document.body.classList.remove('printing'));
  </script>
</body>
</html>